                "link": "hm://z6Mko5npVz4Bx9Rf4vkRUf2swvb568SDbhLwStaha3HzgrLS"
              }
            ],
            "text": "I build rich-text editors, local-first apps, and collaborative publishing tools. I'm currently building Seed Hypermedia, a desktop and web platform for decentralized knowledge collaboration — combining fine-grained linking, embedding, cryptographic authorship, and community-controlled publishing.",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [],
          "block": {
            "type": "Paragraph",
            "id": "JNdZiH9L",
            "revision": "bafyreiemx4e7jy7jznkxtwmahcjslinwk4uyhf6lquaptkncmgusi3kcnu",
            "attributes": {},
            "annotations": [],
            "text": "My work sits at the intersection of product design, frontend architecture, and open-source software. I've contributed to editor ecosystems like Plate and BlockNote, and I care deeply about tools that help people write, publish, discuss, and organize knowledge.",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
